{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地女星劉濤近日出席意大利頂級奢華品牌活動，一襲合身長禮服盡顯優雅身段，竟遭73歲品牌創始人Brunello Cucinelli多次伸出手作肢體觸碰，又順着其肩膀滑落至腰部，並且在移動腳步時，手直接碰觸到劉濤胸壁，動作被內地網友指逾越正常社</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T05:21:13.897502+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T04:15:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T05:18:16.330788+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T05:18:16.330788+00:00","content_hash":"d738b917e5fb71e8c2b3084d783f98156f8a2886df5e4bea0d427d7331441e49","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}